{
  "_about": "Official scam and phishing warnings by country (scripts/scams.mjs, no AI model; feeds.yml every 2 hours). Each issuer is a government body, police force, regulator, national CERT or a state-backed consumer warning service, read from its own machine-readable feed. robots.txt was checked for every feed on 2026-11-21; a feed that refuses automated readers is left out, never worked around (left out for that reason: FTC consumer alerts, Action Fraud, cybermalveillance.gouv.fr (a bot challenge), Moneysmart, PIB India; no feed found: Scamwatch, ACCC, ACMA, Singapore Police and ScamShield, CERT-In, I4C). filter true keeps only items whose title names a scam, fraud or phishing (scripts/scams.mjs SCAM); url_match keeps only items whose link matches. hosts are the issuer's own hosts: an item linking anywhere else is dropped here and again on the page. These are warnings, not cyber events: never drawn on the globe, never counted as events.",
  "max_age_days": 60,
  "keep_days": 90,
  "per_issuer": 40,
